%abc-2.1
% CONTROL — %%vskip, which appears in abcjs's own tests and in NEITHER corpus, and which
% moves the whole page. Three rungs: no vskip, one before a later line, and one before the
% FIRST line (abcjs's `if (abcLine.vskip)` is not guarded on staffgroups.length, so it
% applies there too). Golden generated by running abcjs 6.7.0 at {staffwidth: 670}.
X:1
T:vskip between lines
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|
%%vskip 40
GABc|

X:2
T:vskip before the first line
L:1/4
M:4/4
%%vskip 25
K:C
CDEF|
GABc|

X:3
T:vskip in centimetres
L:1/4
M:4/4
K:C
CDEF|
%%vskip 1cm
GABc|
